"Downstream ISPs, streaming startups and universities. Gear: Edge Lord 400 routers, dark fiber leases, Rainbow-in-a-Box DWDM, Ackackia 400ZR+ optics.":"ISP downstream, startup di streaming e università. Hardware: router Edge Lord 400, affitto di dark fiber, DWDM Rainbow-in-a-Box, ottiche Ackackia 400ZR+.",
