"On":"On",
"Sound":"Suono",
"Auto follows your device’s reduce-motion setting. Off freezes the map: no moving packets, pulses or floating text.":"Auto segue l’impostazione “riduci movimento” del tuo dispositivo. Off congela la mappa: niente pacchetti in movimento, pulsazioni o testo fluttuante.",
"no cable lands here":"nessun cavo approda qui",
"from {price}/mo":"da {price}/mese",
"<b>Welcome back, {name}.</b><br>Your network is right where you left it: {date}.":"<b>Bentornato, {name}.</b><br>La tua rete è proprio dove l’avevi lasciata: {date}.",
"<b>Your saved game could not be loaded.</b><br>It was damaged, so a backup was kept and you can start fresh.":"<b>Impossibile caricare la partita salvata.</b><br>Era danneggiata: ne abbiamo tenuto una copia di backup e puoi ricominciare da zero.",
"Series of Tubes: build the internet, one tube at a time":"Series of Tubes: costruisci internet, un tubo alla volta",
"A free cartoon browser game about how the internet works. Start as a tiny network in one city, launch home broadband, buy IP transit from Tier 1 and Tier 2 carriers, peer at internet exchanges, set up private interconnects and embedded CDN caches, and lay terrestrial fiber, subsea waves and your own dark fiber with DWDM and ZR optics. Sign enterprise, hosting, high-frequency trading, AI GPU and hyperscaler customers, and keep them happy while backhoes, sharks, fat fingers, route leaks, DDoS attacks and geopolitics break things.":"Un gioco gratuito per browser, in stile cartoon, su come funziona internet. Parti come una minuscola rete in una sola città, lancia la banda larga domestica, compra IP transit da carrier Tier 1 e Tier 2, fai peering agli internet exchange, attiva interconnessioni private e cache CDN embedded, e posa fibra terrestre, wave sottomarine e la tua dark fiber con DWDM e ottiche ZR. Firma clienti aziendali, hosting, trading ad alta frequenza, GPU per l’IA e hyperscaler, e tienili contenti mentre ruspe, squali, dita grosse, route leak, attacchi DDoS e geopolitica rompono tutto.",
"Cash · Bank":"Cassa · Banca",
