"Global backbone":"Backbone globale",
"Your ASN now shows up in other people's traceroutes, and in their tickets.":"Il tuo ASN ora compare nei traceroute degli altri, e nei loro ticket.",
"peak 12 Tbps, 25 POPs, 5 continents":"picco 12 Tbps, 25 POP, 5 continenti",
"A free PNI with Voda-Phony. Gear: Absolute Unit 3.2T routers, 3.2T ports and 12.8T waves.":"Un PNI gratuito con Voda-Phony. Gear: router Absolute Unit 3.2T, porte 3.2T e wave 12.8T.",
"Packet empire":"Impero dei pacchetti",
